Bundled source is the portable C implementation required by the public
RNNoise API. SIMD-specific and training-only sources are intentionally omitted.
`rnnoise_model_init.c` is the model-topology function extracted from the
upstream generated `rnnoise_data.c`; the large embedded arrays are replaced by
the checked binary model resource.
